<title>POLAND: Stalexport plans no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Stalexport plans no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader Stalexport SA plans to allot all last year's 22.7-million-zloty net profit to reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Stalexport said management's proposal had to be approved by a general shareholders meeting on May 31.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
